meaning:
A clever double entendre by Rocky;

A. Rocky makes an argument at the idea of a “Romeo and Juliet” situation here by showing that using a Google program in an Apple device worked out poorly. Google and Apple have been long term rivals and pairing them together did not lead to a “Happy ever after” ending.

B. Google and Apple often being referred to as the creme of the crop regarding electronic devices add to the depressing narrative; not even the best (Google and Apple in this case) can guide you through the struggle.
